          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 36,
          "text": "1980",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 36,
          "text": "1980年",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 37,
          "text": "In 2015, Martinez was hired by the MLB Network as a studio analyst",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 38,
          "text": "2015年、MLBネットワークのスタジオ解説者に起用された",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 39,
          "text": "In 1956",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 40,
          "text": "1956年",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 41,
          "text": "In Illinois, the anti-ERA activists used traditional symbols of the American housewife,",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 42,
          "text": "イリノイ州で、反対派は米国の伝統的な主婦の象徴を用いた",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 43,
          "text": "Yanni released If I Could Tell You, his first studio album in seven years.",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 43,
          "text": "7年ぶりのスタジオアルバム「If I Could Tell You」を発表した",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 44,
          "text": "It is not knowing that governs ethical actions, but feelings.",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
          "page": 45,
          "text": "倫理的な行為を動かすのは知識ではなく、感情である",
          "size": 21.0
        },
        {
